y...","s":273.28,"e":274.12,"line":114},{"w":"ain't","s":274.46,"e":274.88,"line":115},{"w":"prophecy.","s":275.3,"e":275.96,"line":115},{"w":"And","s":276.84,"e":277.68,"line":116},{"w":"the","s":282.04,"e":283.02,"line":116},{"w":"odds...","s":283.02,"e":283.1,"line":116},{"w":"don't","s":283.02,"e":283.1,"line":117},{"w":"know","s":283.02,"e":283.1,"line":117},{"w":"me.","s":283.02,"e":283.1,"line":117}],"lines":[{"s":0,"e":0.5,"text":"**[Intro — Female Vocal, Solo Grand Piano]**"},{"s":1.42,"e":8.48,"text":"They counted every reason I should never reach the sky,"},{"s":8.48,"e":15.34,"text":"Put percentages beside me, put the pressure way up high."},{"s":15.34,"e":17.48,"text":"But numbers know my history—"},{"s":17.78,"e":21.04,"text":"They don't know what I'll be."},{"s":21.44,"e":25.14,"text":"No, the odds know what I've been through..."},{"s":25.14,"e":27.92,"text":"**The odds don't know me.**"},{"s":27.92,"e":28.42,"text":"**[Beat Begins to Rise]**"},{"s":27.92,"e":28.31,"text":"Mm-mm..."},{"s":28.7,"e":35.8,"text":"They don't know me."},{"s":36.31,"e":36.5,"text":"Mm-mm..."},{"s":36.5,"e":37.92,"text":"Watch me."},{"s":37.92,"e":38.42,"text":"**[Verse 1 — Male Lead]**"},{"s":43.28,"e":46.36,"text":"Long shots, locked doors, low expectations,"},{"s":47.14,"e":49.6,"text":"Cold nights, closed minds, whole conversations."},{"s":50.54,"e":52.64,"text":"\"Can't win, won't work, kid, reconsider,\""},{"s":52.7,"e":56.12,"text":"I turned that doubt into drive—now the dream got bigger."},{"s":57.08,"e":58.62,"text":"Pressure pressed, but I pressed right back,"},{"s":58.62,"e":60.3,"text":"Pain made patterns, I challenged the facts."},{"s":60.3,"e":61.94,"text":"Mind said, *\"Man, you're probably done,\"*"},{"s":61.94,"e":63.86,"text":"I said, *\"That's one thought—not the only one.\"*"},{"s":63.86,"e":65.34,"text":"Check that thought, check that fear,"},{"s":65.34,"e":67.1,"text":"Is it fact—or a feeling appearing sincere?"},{"s":67.1,"e":68.72,"text":"I can feel that fire without feeding the flame,"},{"s":68.72,"e":70.54,"text":"Let the fear ride shotgun—I still steer the lane."},{"s":71.1,"e":74.02,"text":"They saw the storm and predicted rain,"},{"s":74.36,"e":77.22,"text":"Never saw me learning to dance through pain."},{"s":77.22,"e":80.38,"text":"They measured my past like my past was destiny—"},{"s":81.02,"e":81.82,"text":"But probability"},{"s":81.82,"e":83.72,"text":"Ain't prophecy."},{"s":84.66,"e":87.24,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":87.24,"e":90.06,"text":"They know the numbers, not the nights I didn't sleep."},{"s":91.66,"e":94.1,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":94.1,"e":97.06,"text":"They know the mountain, not the miles in my feet."},{"s":98.4,"e":100.36,"text":"One in a million?"},{"s":100.38,"e":102.16,"text":"**Then somebody's one.**"},{"s":102.16,"e":103.78,"text":"Say it can't happen?"},{"s":103.78,"e":105.54,"text":"**Then watch what I've done.**"},{"s":105.48,"e":108.78,"text":"You can count every reason that I shouldn't succeed—"},{"s":108.78,"e":111.04,"text":"**But the odds don't know me,"},{"s":111.04,"e":112.7,"text":"the odds don't know me.**"},{"s":115.96,"e":117.12,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":119.02,"e":120.26,"text":"No, the odds don't know me."},{"s":120.26,"e":122.04,"text":"Built from the bottom with belief in the bricks,"},{"s":122.04,"e":123.64,"text":"Calm in the chaos, calculated with clicks."},{"s":123.7,"e":125.46,"text":"Wise mind working when the wild mind screams,"},{"s":125.46,"e":127.06,"text":"Feet on the floor while I follow my dreams."},{"s":127.1,"e":129.14,"text":"Name five things that I see, four things I can touch,"},{"s":129.14,"e":130.88,"text":"Bring myself back when the future feels too much."},{"s":130.88,"e":132.58,"text":"Breathe, then decide—don't decide from distress,"},{"s":132.64,"e":134.24,"text":"Small step, strong step, stack that success."},{"s":134.24,"e":135.98,"text":"When my fear says freeze, I move with intention,"},{"s":135.98,"e":137.7,"text":"When shame says shrink, I challenge convention."},{"s":137.82,"e":139.54,"text":"Opposite action—I'm attacking avoidance,"},{"s":139.54,"e":141.14,"text":"Turn down the panic, turn up my own voice."},{"s":141.14,"e":143.22,"text":"No magic mindset pretending pain isn't real,"},{"s":143.22,"e":144.94,"text":"I accept what's here—then choose how I deal."},{"s":144.94,"e":147.2,"text":"Radical acceptance doesn't mean I agree—"},{"s":147.68,"e":151.1,"text":"It means reality doesn't get to imprison me."},{"s":151.1,"e":151.6,"text":"**[Pre-Chorus — Female, Bigger]**"},{"s":151.1,"e":154,"text":"They saw the scars and predicted defeat,"},{"s":154,"e":157.1,"text":"Never saw the strength underneath."},{"s":157.1,"e":160.46,"text":"They measured yesterday like tomorrow was guaranteed—"},{"s":160.46,"e":161.92,"text":"But probability"},{"s":161.92,"e":163.8,"text":"Ain't prophecy."},{"s":164.9,"e":167.24,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":167.24,"e":170.18,"text":"They know the numbers, not the nights I didn't sleep."},{"s":171.42,"e":174,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":174,"e":177.02,"text":"They know the mountain, not the miles in my feet."},{"s":178.38,"e":180.36,"text":"One in a million?"},{"s":180.54,"e":182.16,"text":"**Then somebody's one.**"},{"s":182.16,"e":183.8,"text":"Say it can't happen?"},{"s":183.8,"e":185.52,"text":"**Then watch what I've done.**"},{"s":185.46,"e":188.42,"text":"You can count every reason that I shouldn't succeed—"},{"s":188.86,"e":190.84,"text":"**But the odds don't know me,"},{"s":190.84,"e":192.8,"text":"the odds don't know me.**"},{"s":192.8,"e":193.3,"text":"**[Bridge — Piano Only, Female → Male]**"},{"s":192.8,"e":192.88,"text":"**Female:**"},{"s":192.8,"e":196.9,"text":"Maybe the thought isn't true just because it feels true."},{"s":199.2,"e":205.22,"text":"Maybe the fear isn't fate just because it found you."},{"s":205.22,"e":205.55,"text":"**Male:**"},{"s":205.88,"e":209.22,"text":"Maybe I'm scared and still stepping ahead."},{"s":209.22,"e":213,"text":"Maybe courage is moving while fear's in my head."},{"s":212.98,"e":213.12,"text":"**Female:**"},{"s":213.26,"e":215.26,"text":"You don't need certainty."},{"s":215.26,"e":215.47,"text":"**Male:**"},{"s":215.68,"e":217.24,"text":"Just the next move."},{"s":217.24,"e":217.32,"text":"**Both:**"},{"s":217.24,"e":218.62,"text":"One wise decision..."},{"s":218.62,"e":220.84,"text":"Then another comes through."},{"s":220.84,"e":221.8,"text":"Count me out—"},{"s":221.96,"e":223.8,"text":"I'll count myself in."},{"s":223.8,"e":225.38,"text":"Fall seven times—"},{"s":225.42,"e":227.24,"text":"Find eight ways to win."},{"s":227.24,"e":228.7,"text":"Count me out—"},{"s":228.76,"e":230.66,"text":"I'll count myself in."},{"s":230.66,"e":232.34,"text":"**If the odds say no—"},{"s":232.36,"e":234.86,"text":"LET THE STORY BEGIN.**"},{"s":234.86,"e":235.36,"text":"**[FINAL CHORUS — Massive]**"},{"s":234.86,"e":237.02,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":237.02,"e":239.98,"text":"They know the numbers, not the nerve underneath."},{"s":241.32,"e":243.82,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":243.82,"e":247.22,"text":"They know the struggle, not the strength that it breeds."},{"s":248.7,"e":250.18,"text":"One in a billion?"},{"s":250.34,"e":252.04,"text":"**Then somebody's one.**"},{"s":252.04,"e":253.58,"text":"Whole world doubting?"},{"s":253.58,"e":255.32,"text":"**I'm still not done.**"},{"s":255.32,"e":258.34,"text":"Let 'em calculate chances, let 'em calculate dreams—"},{"s":258.66,"e":260.68,"text":"They can measure every mountain,"},{"s":260.68,"e":262.48,"text":"**THEY CAN'T MEASURE ME.**"},{"s":262.48,"e":264.18,"text":"**THE ODDS DON'T KNOW ME!**"},{"s":264.18,"e":267.08,"text":"No, the odds don't know me."},{"s":267.08,"e":269.12,"text":"They can predict the past—"},{"s":269.04,"e":271.04,"text":"**BUT THEY CAN'T PREDICT ME.**"},{"s":273.28,"e":274.12,"text":"Probability..."},{"s":274.46,"e":275.96,"text":"ain't prophecy."},{"s":276.84,"e":283.1,"text":"And the odds..."},{"s":283.02,"e":283.1,"text":"don't know me."}],"duration":283.04,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:35:51.754Z","stats":{"whisperWords":728,"polishedWords":681,"matched":632,"matchRate":0.928}}